3.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"\r\n\r\n- [X] Related issues linked using `fixes #number`\r\n- [X] Tests added. See: https://github.com/vercel/next.js/blob/canary/contributing/core/testing.md#writing-tests-for-nextjs\r\n\r\n\r\n### What\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes the issue of `<a>` tags for internal routing not being caught by linting in the app directory.\r\n\r\n### How\r\n\r\n- Added a new function to parse the URLs in the appDir (since it's a bit different from the `/pages` directory\r\n- Lint now checks against pagesUrls and appUrls\r\n- Added tests for the appDir in the `no-html-link-for-pages` test file\r\n\r\n### Additional comment\r\nMaybe the rule should be renamed since it now checks against `/pages` and `/app` to something like `no-html-link-for-internal-routing`?\r\n\r\nfixes #51742 \r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/51783/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/51783/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/comments/1606094119","html_url":"https://github.com/vercel/next.js/issues/51742#issuecomment-1606094119","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vercel/next.js/issues/51742","id":1606094119,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBC3Cis5fuw0n","user":{"login":"Nick-surferboy","id":124938602,"node_id":"U_kgDOB3Jpag","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124938602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nick-surferboy","html_url":"https://github.com/Nick-surferboy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nick-surferboy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nick-surferboy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nick-surferboy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nick-surferboy/starred{/own